  "bodyHash": "sN8lOZyjF/A=",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。用心製作。大量支援 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>流浪商人可以離開（Wandering Trader May Leave）提供了一個簡單的方式，讓玩家可以要求流浪商人離開地圖，而無需訴諸暴力。它在交易畫面的左上角新增了一個小按鈕。點擊後，商人會在一陣粒子效果中消失。你不再需要殺死它來換取片刻安寧。<br><br>商人的羊駝也會消失，但僅限於牠們被拴繩拴在流浪商人身上時。此行為可在配置中更改。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg&w=586\" alt=\"環境：客戶端與伺服器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>despawnTraderLlamasToo</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true<br>是否在按下按鈕時，讓商人的羊駝也隨流浪商人一起消失。<br><br><span><strong>onlyDespawnLlamasWhenLeashed</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true<br>是否僅在羊駝被拴繩拴在流浪商人身上時才讓牠們消失。<br><br><span><strong>showDespawnParticles</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true<br>是否在流浪商人或商人羊駝消失時顯示粒子效果。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/commands.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"指令\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><em>/wandering-trader spawn</em> - 不小心讓流浪商人離開了？用它重生吧！<br><strong>此指令需要作弊權限。</strong></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>新增了一個小按鈕：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wandering-trader-may-leave/a.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>只需點擊按鈕，它就消失了！</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wandering-trader-may-leave/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，前提是下載檔案仍託管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含了所有可用模組的概述和更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若遇到問題、有想法、建議或其他任何事項，請前往&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
